{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41513","headline":"九日陪董内召登高 · 廖匡图","name":"九日陪董内召登高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祝融峰下逢嘉节，相对那能不怆神。\n烟里共寻幽磵菊，樽前俱是异乡人。\n遥山带日应连越，孤雁来时想别秦。\n自古登高尽惆怅，茱萸休笑泪盈巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖匡图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}